  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/610492/description_19c704fd-83da-48c6-93bc-c39ae13831db.png\" alt=\"Naturalist\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maQ6tE6Nsd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1378839788659933345?style=flat-square&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Discord&color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/naturalist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/627986?style=flat-square&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label=CurseForge&color=f16436\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnaturalist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/naturalist?style=flat-square&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=Modrinth&color=00af5c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/naturalist/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/MC-1.18.2--1.20.1-6b6b88?style=flat-square&logo=minecraft&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Versions\"></a></p>\n<h3>📋 關於</h3>\n<p><strong>Naturalist</strong> 為你的世界增添了 24 種動物（及其變體），旨在讓它們無縫融入原版遊戲體驗中。你會發現這些生物之間或與周圍環境產生互動，其中一些還可以被馴服。</p>",
